  "releaseNotes": "- **Added `NadeoAPI.RequestInterval` to pace requests across all Nadeo clients**\n- Added constructors with an application User-Agent to `NadeoServices`, `NadeoLiveServices`, and `NadeoMeetServices`\n- Fixed a rejected refresh token not signing in again with saved credentials\n- Fixed `GetLeaderboardPositionsByTimeAsync` without groups sending only the first map\n- Changed `GetLeaderboardPositionsByTimeAsync` and `GetPlayerRecordsAsync` to throw `ArgumentException` for mismatched inputs\n- Fixed URL escaping of map UIDs in `GetMapInfosAsync` and `GetFavoriteMapsByUidsAsync`, and of zone IDs in `GetSurroundingRecordsAsync`\n- Updated TmEssentials to 2.9.1",
